   "name": "Melanie Spragg",
   "text": "Rob built and fitted my media wall, wardrobes and floors in August 2025.\n\nHe came and measured up and designed everything I wanted to fit the spaces.  Lovely guy, easy to deal with and friendly,    Overall a very professional job and I was thrilled with the outcome as you can see from the photos.   I would not hesitate to recommend him.",
   "owner_reply": ""
  },
  {
   "rating": 5,
   "date": "5 months ago",
   "name": "Kirsty Fielding",
   "text": "I was passed Robs details over from a friend who was eager to recommend him when I was looking for a joiner.\nI am absolutely delighted with my new kitchen and cannot recommend Rob highly enough. I was very indecisive throughout the process, but he was incredibly patient and never once made me feel rushed or pressured. He provided free plans and updated them quickly every time I changed my mind, which I really appreciated.\n\nCommunication was always prompt and professional, and he always turned up exactly when he said he would — something that is hard to find these days. He never let us down and completed the whole job from start to finish in just a few days, all to an excellent standard.\n\nThe attention to detail, reliability, and overall quality of work has been fantastic, and I am so pleased with the finished result. I would happily recommend him to anyone looking for a trustworthy and skilled builder who will get the absolute best out of your budget.",
   "owner_reply": ""
  },
